~ day_start
Mum: One day down, [color=firebrick]two[/color] to go! Honey, how are you holding up?
Kid: Just fine, Mom! I think I figured out how to [color=goldenrod]knock leaves[/color] off the window! My raindrops have a better chance of winning now.
Mum: That's... great. Just don't hurt yourself!
Kid: Now, if I [color=goldenrod]click on my hand,[/color] I can use it to knock obstacles off the window!

do game.begin_game()

=> END


~ day_end
Mum: Oh look, the [color=goldenrod]sun[/color] is out!
Kid: Are we there yet?
Mum: [color=goldenrod]Almost![/color]

do game.end_day()

=> END